      <title>Version 0.5.147</title>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <h2>What's New in 0.5.147</h2>
        <h3>Bug Fixes</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Fixed Audio Unit sample downloads that could fail or remain stuck while downloading.</li>
          <li>Fixed MIDI-triggered playback crackle caused by blocking downloader work in the audio path.</li>
          <li>Improved bundled FFmpeg HTTPS certificate handling on macOS hosts.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="source">Build 1208 · <a href="https://github.com/danielraffel/PlunderTube/commit/bae16bf5">bae16bf5</a> on audio-crackle-fix-0.5.146</p>
